summary: The initial Knowmine source app lands with scan suggestions and an inventory organized by locations, categories, and tags.
---

The initial Knowmine source app offered photo, barcode, and receipt suggestions
for review, plus saved inventory organized by locations, categories, and tags.
A suggestion was not an automatically saved item. The source included session
auth and a Bun + SvelteKit + Drizzle/LibSQL monorepo. The toolchain later
migrated to **tsgo**, dependencies were upgraded, and docs were rebranded from
Proomptal to Aylith.
